{title: 313 - Just as I Am}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Gospel}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[D/A]Just [Em/G]as [D/F#]I [A]am, [D/A]without [C#dim]one [G/D]plea,
[A/C#]But that [F#m/A]Thy blood [A7/G]was [G]shed [A7/G]for [D/A]me,
[A]And that [Bm]Thou [F#m/C#]bidst [D7/C]me [Bm]come to [Em/B]Thee,
[A]O Lamb [D/F#]of [Em/B]God, [D/A]I come, [Em/G]I [D/F#]come.

Verse 2:
[D/A]Just [Em/G]as [D/F#]I [A]am, [D/A]and [Bm]waiting [G/D]not
[A/C#]To rid [F#m/A]my soul [A7/G]of [G]one [A7/G]dark [D/A]blot,
[A]To Thee [Bm]whose [F#m/C#]blood [D7/C]can [Bm]cleanse each [Em/B]spot,
[A]O Lamb [D/F#]of [Em/B]God, [D/A]I come, [Em/G]I [D/F#]come.

Verse 3:
[D/A]Just [Em/G]as [D/F#]I [A]am, [D/A]though [Bm]tossed [C#dim]about
[A/C#]With many [F#m/A]a [Em/G]conflict, [D/A]many [A7/G]a [D/A]doubt,
[A]"Fightings [Bm]within, [D7/C]and [Bm]fears without,"
[A]O Lamb [D/F#]of [Em/B]God, [D/A]I come, [Em/G]I [D/F#]come.

Verse 4:
[D/A]Just [Em/G]as [D/F#]I [A]am, [Bm]poor, [C#dim]wretched, [G/D]blind;
[A/C#]Sight, riches, [F#m/A]healing [G]of [A7/G]the [D/A]mind,
[A]Yea, all [Bm]I [F#m/C#]need [D7/C]in [Bm]Thee to [Em/B]find,
[A]O Lamb [D/F#]of [Em/B]God, [D/A]I come, [Em/G]I [D/F#]come.

Verse 5:
[D/A]Just [Em/G]as [D/F#]I [A]am, [D/A]Thou [Bm]wilt [C#dim]receive,
[A/C#]Wilt welcome, [F#m/A]pardon, [G]cleanse, [A7/G]relieve;
[A]Because [Bm]Thy [F#m/C#]promise [Bm]I believe,
[A]O Lamb [D/F#]of [Em/B]God, [D/A]I come, [Em/G]I [D/F#]come.

Verse 6:
[D/A]Just [Em/G]as [D/F#]I [A]am, [D/A]Thy [Bm]love [C#dim]I [G/D]own
[A/C#]Has broken [F#m/A]every [G]barrier [D/A]down;
[A]Now, to [Bm]be [F#m/C#]Thine, [D7/C]and [Bm]Thine alone,
[A]O Lamb [D/F#]of [Em/B]God, [D/A]I come, [Em/G]I [D/F#]come.
